  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ([Design and Access Statement], [T19/056-PL001], Received: 04/12/2020; [T19/056-PL100E], [T19/056-PL200RevB], [T19/056-PL300D], Received: 17/02/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved, the cycle parking provision show on drawing number: T19/056-PL-100E must be implemented and retained as such thereafter throughout the lifetime of the development.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the development hereby permitted is first brought into use, a visibility splay of 2.4 metres x 2.4 metres shall be provided on each side of the vehicular access (the depth measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access). Thereafter, no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6 metres in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected, planted or allowed to grow within the areas of such splays.",
    "Condition : 5 - The marketing suite hereby approved must be removed within 12 years of the date of this permission, in accordance with the submitted Unilateral Undertaking."
  ],
